+   e. Compute loss `loss_plus` between `mesh_plus` and target [S1, unofficial].
+   f. Perturb: `sdf[i] -= 2 * eps` (resulting in `sdf_orig - eps`).
+   g. Extract mesh `mesh_minus` [S1, unofficial].
